{
  "page_id": "SR-37",
  "section_header": "STEERING — Power Steering",
  "title": "STEERING — Power Steering",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "8. INSTALL CLAW WASHER AND RACK ENDS"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Install the claw washer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE: Align the claw of the claw washer with the rack groove."
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(b) Tighten the rack end and torque it with SST.",
        "SST 09612-24012 (09617-22030, 09617-24010)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Rack end",
      "value": "1,050 kg·cm (76 ft-lb, 103 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(c) Stake the claw washer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Illustration showing installation of claw washer and rack ends using SST tool",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 5,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "9. INSTALL CONTROL VALVE ASSEMBLY INTO CONTROL VALVE HOUSING"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "10. INSTALL CONTROL VALVE SPRING SEAT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "11. INSTALL COMPRESSION SPRING"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "12. INSTALL O-RING AND CONTROL VALVE HOUSING TO RACK HOUSING"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Align the marks on the control housing and rack housing.",
        "(b) Coat liquid sealer onto the screw surface of the bolt.",
        "(c) Install the three bolts and torque them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Three bolts",
      "value": "185 kg·cm (13 ft-lb, 18 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Illustration showing installation of O-ring and control valve housing to rack housing with SST tool and alignment marks",
      "labels": [
        "SST",
        "10°"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 28,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "13. ADJUST CONTROL VALVE SHAFT PRELOAD"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Coat liquid sealer onto the screw surface of the bolt.",
        "(b) Tighten the pinion adjusting screw and torque with SST.",
        "SST (09612-24012 (09612-10021)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Pinion adjusting screw",
      "value": "150 kg·cm (11 ft-lb, 15 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(c) Return the pinion adjusting screw 10°.",
        "(d) Using SST, measure the preload.",
        "SST 09616-00010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Preload (turning)",
      "value": "4.5 — 6.5 kg·cm (3.9 — 5.6 in.-lb, 0.4 — 0.6 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If incorrect, readjust."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Illustration showing measurement of control valve shaft preload using SST tool",
      "labels": [
        "SST",
        "SST 09616-00010"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 50,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "14. INSTALL PINION ADJUSTING SCREW LOCK NUT"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) Coat liquid sealer onto the lock nut and gear housing contact surfaces.",
        "(b) Install the pinion adjusting screw lock nut and torque it with SST.",
        "SST 09612-24012 (09612-10021, 09617-24020)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Pinion adjusting screw lock nut",
      "value": "700 kg·cm (51 ft-lb, 69 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(c) Recheck the control valve shaft preload."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Preload (turning)",
      "value": "4.5 — 6.5 kg·cm (3.9 — 5.6 in.-lb, 0.4 — 0.6 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Illustration showing installation of pinion adjusting screw lock nut using SST tool",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 73,
        "left": 2,
        "width": 45,
        "height": 18
      }
    }
  ]
}
